      <Docs>
        <summary>Supports Call Composer as defined in section 2.4 of RC.20.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>This is the superset Call Composer capability. All Call Composer subset capabilities, including <see cref="F:Android.Telephony.Ims.Feature.MmTelCapabilityType.CallComposerBusinessOnly" />, must also be enabled when this capability is enabled.</para>
          <para>
            <format type="text/html">
              <a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/telephony/ims/feature/MmTelFeature.MmTelCapabilities#CAPABILITY_TYPE_CALL_COMPOSER" title="Reference documentation">Java documentation for <code>android.telephony.ims.feature.MmTelFeature.MmTelCapabilities.CAPABILITY_TYPE_CALL_COMPOSER</code>.</a>
