      <Docs>
        <summary>Supports the business-only subset of Call Composer information.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>This capability only supports business-related calling information in the SIP header, such as whether a call is a business call. When <see cref="F:Android.Telephony.Ims.Feature.MmTelCapabilityType.CallComposer" /> is enabled, this capability must also be enabled.</para>
          <para>
            <format type="text/html">
              <a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/telephony/ims/feature/MmTelFeature.MmTelCapabilities#CAPABILITY_TYPE_CALL_COMPOSER_BUSINESS_ONLY" title="Reference documentation">Java documentation for <code>android.telephony.ims.feature.MmTelFeature.MmTelCapabilities.CAPABILITY_TYPE_CALL_COMPOSER_BUSINESS_ONLY</code>.</a>
